s/7974","id":187486141,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE4NzQ4NjE0MQ==","user":{"login":"xavier83ar","id":1458700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTg3MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1458700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar","html_url":"https://github.com/xavier83ar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-02-23T02:16:12Z","updated_at":"2016-02-23T02:16:12Z","body":"I've found a similar issue trying to test a controller action that should returns a file. After a little research I think that the problem is [here](https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/blob/master/src/Network/Response.php#L1565). \nIt seems that in this line cakephp is closing buffers that it should not, I'm not sure about that, but if I remove that line, test runs as expected. \n\nIt seems that when raising the exception, PhpUnit checks the value of `ob_get_level()` before run a test and then recheck after run it, and those values doesn't match, due to the call to `ob_end_clean()`.\n\nTo reproduce the issue (at least the one that I've found), just create a method that returns a file and test it.\n\n``` php\nclass ExamplesController extends AppController \n{\n    public function getFile() \n    {\n        $this->response->file('/some/file.ext');\n        return $this->response;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n``` php\nclass ExamplesControllerTest extends IntegrationTestCase\n{\n    public function testGetFile()\n    {\n        $this->get('/examples/get-file');\n        $this->assertResponseOk();\n    }\n}\n```\n\nThis code has not been tested but I think it should help, or at least I hope so.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/187486141/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"xavier83ar","id":1458700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTg3MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1458700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar","html_url":"https://github.com/xavier83ar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xavier83ar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/187486558","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/7974#issuecomment-187486558","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/7974","id":187486558,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE4NzQ4NjU1OA==","user":{"login":"xavier83ar","id":1458700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTg3MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1458700?v=4","gr